########################## 🟦 5. Streaming Architecture (Clickstream Case)

***

## ✅ Step 1: Event Ingestion

👉 Tools:

* Kafka / AWS MSK / Kinesis

Event Example:

```json
{
  "user_id": "u1",
  "event": "product_click",
  "product_id": "coffee1",
  "timestamp": "2026-06-12T10:00:00"
}
```

***

## ✅ Step 2: Stream Processing

```python
stream_df = spark.readStream \
    .format("kafka") \
    .option("subscribe", "clickstream") \
    .load()

parsed = stream_df.selectExpr("CAST(value AS STRING)") \
    .select(from_json("value", schema).alias("data"))

aggregated = parsed.groupBy("customer_group").count()
```

👉 Why:

* Real-time insights
* Low latency

***

## ✅ Step 3: Sink

```python
aggregated.writeStream \
    .format("parquet") \
    .option("path", "s3://gold/") \
    .start()
```

