4.Internal Delta Merge
Ans.
MERGE INTO target t
USING source s
ON t.id=s.id
WHEN MATCHED UPDATE
WHEN NOT MATCHED INSERT

Internally:
1. Reads matching files
2. Creates new parquet files
3. Updates delta log
4. Commits transaction
5. Old files marked obsolete
No in-place updates.

